@startuml
title OC-D02 Operator Console Authority Boundary

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220

component "Operator Console\noperations / governance /\nread-only visibility" as Console
component "Central PMS\npayment finality\nfiscal reference recording\nnormal ExitAuthorization" as Central
component "POS Server\nfiscal issuance\nfiscal numbering only" as Pos
component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider interaction\nverified provider evidence only" as Pay
component "Vendor PMS\nraw parking session lifecycle\nnormal tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Gate Integration\nvalidate / consume / open / report\nthrough Central PMS authorization" as Gate
component "Audit / Event\ntraceability and non-repudiation" as Audit

Console --> Central : read context\nsubmit governed workflows
Console --> Audit : audit operator actions

Central --> Pay : accepts verified provider evidence
Central --> Pos : requests fiscal issuance\nrecords fiscal reference
Central --> Vendor : reads normalized session/tariff context\nthrough connector
Central --> Gate : issues authorization for gate consumption

Pay -[#blue]-> Central : reports verified outcome
Pos -[#blue]-> Central : returns fiscal evidence only
Vendor -[#blue]-> Central : session/tariff facts
Gate -[#blue]-> Central : consume/open/report result

Console -[#red,dashed]-> Pay : cannot interact with providers
Console -[#red,dashed]-> Pos : cannot issue/retry/readback fiscal documents
Console -[#red,dashed]-> Vendor : cannot mutate vendor session/tariff
Console -[#red,dashed]-> Gate : cannot open gates
Console -[#red,dashed]-> Central : cannot mutate payment finality\nor issue normal ExitAuthorization

note right of Console
Can see and govern.
Cannot mutate payment,
fiscal issuance,
ExitAuthorization,
or gate execution.
end note

@enduml
